<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5476/5486.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5476/5486.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5476/5486 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Friday will be 5481.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the bid/offer rates were 5473/5483, with the official dollar rate 5478 from Thursady.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5372/5972 after 5369/5969.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
